<p>The history of advertisements is the story of their continual expansion into newly created spaces. Those spaces are becoming increasingly proximal and yet invasive by the same measure. This is a story about that trajectory mixed with the anomalous, and is a horror piece imo.</p>
<p>This is also in sort of thanks that even after 10 years, we don't have to suffer through ads on this site. Could be much worse folks.</p>
<p>All images are from Wiki Commons (see below).</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2303803&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534259570" alt="Cyantreuse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2303803)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cyantreuse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2303803); return false;">Cyantreuse</a></span> for taking the initiative to improve the main image, great work, and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534259570" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span> &amp; <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/countless-skies" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3477314); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3477314&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534259570" alt="Countless Skies" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3477314)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/countless-skies" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3477314); return false;">Countless Skies</a></span> for their critique of the draft, which was prior to my decision to fashion this into a 4kon entry, so sorry if this is embarrassing.</p>
