Thank you. Yeah, I am discovering just how hard it can be to play a Trump-derived character in a subtle way. Subtle is the last adjective for him. I wonder if it may be better actually, and you know I respect your opinion very much, to just make it explicit at the end of the transcripts, no black boxes. Because I am less interested in making it a reveal (doesn’t seem to be working anyway) then I am pressing forward the Trump.</p>
